<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25018" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">irrŭmo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inr-</span></b> ), āvi, ātum,
		1, v. a.
		ruma, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to extend the breast to</i>, <i>to give
			suck;</i> hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In
			mal. part., <i><span class="en">Cat. 16, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Auct.
				Priap. 36, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 4,
				50, 2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>To treat in a foul</i> or <i>shameful
				manner</i>, <i>to abuse</i>, <i>deceive</i>, <i><span class="en">Cat. 28,
			9</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			Irrumata unda, i. e. <i>defiled</i>, <i><span class="en">Mart. 2,
				70, 3</span></i>.</div>
